# Render Comments in Post Detail

We'll fetch comments in the post page and include them below the content.

```jsx
const comments = await prisma.comment.findMany({
  where: { postId: post.id },
  include: { user: true },
  orderBy: { createdAt: 'asc' },
});
```

Then map them to show username and comment text. Since the page revalidates after a comment is posted, the new comment appears.
